// ---------- International Commerce Centre (KPF 2010; 484 m to the parapets, roof ~478 m, 108 storeys, sky100 at 393 m) ----------
// Square plan ~60.8 m across the faces (OSM footprint) with V-notched re-entrant corners, a gentle taper, a slight flare where it
// leaves the Elements podium, fine vertical mullion fins, a 6 m glass parapet crown. Local axes along the faces (placement rot
// 0.763 = the footprint's face direction): +x face = NE, +z = SE, -x = SW, -z = NW. Night: lit floors (cool white) on all faces; the light show is its own additive shader layer (soft white-to-blue
// rising bands and a sweeping diagonal graphic, a warm phase now and then) on
// the two harbour-facing faces (SE, SW; the real show covers two facades, ~50 000 m2), red aviation lights.
