// ---------- Kowloon Station and the Union Square development above it ----------
// The Airport Express / Tung Chung Line station is under the Union Square podium (the Elements mall, 2007), so the station is
// modelled as that podium: the real OSM outline of Elements at ~20 m with its roof structures, the station's roof pavilion over the
// concourse, Civic Square's gardens on the roof. Every tower that stands on the podium (their real OSM footprints and tagged
// heights) is rebuilt in `hkkowloonstation_b` (unlabelled): The Waterfront (7 x 142 m), Sorrento (256 / 236 / 218 / 212 / 206 m),
// The Harbourside (255 m), The Arch (231 m: four towers, the pairs bridged from 160 m to the top, as mapped in OSM) and
// The Cullinan (270 m, stepped wings 230 / 220 and 145 m). The ICC is its own landmark (hkicc).
